    "Description": "The golang packages provide the Go programming language compiler.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* net/textproto: golang: Golang net/textproto: Misleading error messages via input injection (CVE-2026-42507)\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):\n\n* Update Go to version 1.26.4+1 [rhel-9.8.z] (JIRA:RHEL-183350)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
